ent-Holoprojector = 全息標誌投影機 | holographic sign projector
    .desc = 一款方便實用的全息投影機，能投影出清潔人員的標誌。 | A handy-dandy holographic projector that displays a janitorial sign.
ent-HoloprojectorEmpty = { ent-Holoprojector }
    .desc = { ent-Holoprojector.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-HoloprojectorBorg = 全息投影機 | holosign projector
    .desc = 一款經改良、適用於維護型賽博格的全息標誌投影機。具備自動充電功能。 | A modified holographic sign projector for use in custodial cyborgs. Automatically self-charges.
    .suffix = borg
ent-HoloprojectorClownBorg = Holopeel 投影機 | holopeel projector
    .desc = 一款全息剝皮投影機，能投射出光滑且堅硬的「光影香蕉皮」。它可重複充電，讓樂趣永無止境！ | A holopeel projector that creates a slippery, hard light banana peel. It recharges, so that the fun never ends!
    .suffix = borg
ent-HolofanProjector = 全息風扇投影機 | holofan projector
    .desc = 在「atmos」緊急狀況發生時，阻止有自殺傾向的乘客殺害所有人。 | Stop suicidal passengers from killing everyone during atmos emergencies.
ent-HolofanProjectorEmpty = { ent-HolofanProjector }
    .desc = { ent-HolofanProjector.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-HolofanProjectorBorg = 整合式全息風扇 | integrated holofan
    .desc = 可防止白癡在大氣緊急狀況下對船員造成更多傷害。直接安裝於工程型賽博格身上，並會隨時間自動充電。 | Stops idiots from causing more crew harm during atmospheric emergencies. Installed directly into an engineering cyborg, it recharges over time.
ent-HoloprojectorXenoField = Xenoborg 偏轉力場投射器 | Xenoborg deflector field projector
    .desc = 一種外星裝置，能投射出能偏轉彈道的力場。 | An alien device, projecting fields that deflect projectiles.
ent-HoloprojectorField = 力場投影機 | force field projector
    .desc = 會產生一道無法穿越的力場，任何東西都無法穿過。若靠近此力場，可能或不可能導致癌症。 | Creates an impassable forcefield that won't let anything through. Close proximity may or may not cause cancer.
ent-HoloprojectorFieldEmpty = { ent-HoloprojectorField }
    .desc = { ent-HoloprojectorField.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-HoloprojectorSecurity = 全息屏障投影機 | holobarrier projector
    .desc = 創造一道堅實卻脆弱的全息屏障。 | Creates a solid but fragile holographic barrier.
ent-HoloprojectorSecurityEmpty = { ent-HoloprojectorSecurity }
    .desc = { ent-HoloprojectorSecurity.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
